I discarded the 2♣ and one of the 7s (I took the 7♠ and kept the 7♦). That breaks the pair, so you're now holding K♥, 7♦, 9♥ and two new cards: 3♠ and Q♦. You have a king-high hand with no pair. Your move: check or bet.

